  - choiceText: "D\u1EA1, d\u1EEBa n\u01B0\u1EDBc ch\u1EA5m \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng \u0103n ngon h\u1EBFt s\u1EA9y!"
    responseLine: "Hahaha, \u0111\xFAng \u0111i\u1EC7u d\xE2n C\xE0 Mau r\u1ED3i \u0111\xF3 ch\xE1u!"
    responseAnim: Male_Talking_01
